{"version":1,"content":"<p>知名科技股多頭丹·艾夫斯（Dan Ives）認為，黃仁勳的價值大約相當於英偉達總市值的30%。這位前韋德布殊證券公司分析師周二表示，如果這位 AI 晶片巨頭的掌舵人離開，英偉達的市值或將縮水近三分之一。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585902.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T07:34:30.616657+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":106,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T07:20:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T07:27:50.384272+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T07:27:50.384272+00:00","content_hash":"8705e19370d1b3855397ae2e69c54bf6737e5dffa8511701ebf80369f6abb000","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}